    "title": "Gale Warning Stretches the East Coast From Maine to Florida - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By County Herald Weather Center ,\n6 hours ago Country Herald is Local News, Independent Pulse. Covering breaking local news, sports, lifestyle and events. A powerful storm system is driving widespread gale-force winds along the entire U.S. East Coast, prompting multiple Gale Warnings from the Gulf of Maine southward to Florida waters. The National Weather Service and Ocean Prediction Center warn that conditions will be dangerous for all marine interests through Thursday night and into Friday in some areas. […] This content first appeared on CountryHerald.com and is protected by copyright law. Unauthorized reproduction, redistribution, or republication of this content, in whole or in part, without expressed written permission from Country Herald is strictly prohibited. Violators may be subject to legal action. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
